@dataclass(repr=False)
class ExcIEEEST6B(ExcitationSystemDynamics):
    '''
    IEEE 421.5-2005 type ST6B model. This model consists of a PI voltage regulator
    with an inner loop field voltage regulator and pre-control. The field voltage
    regulator implements a proportional control. The pre-control and the delay
    in the feedback circuit increase the dynamic response. This model is not
    supporting Vb signal in a correct way, hence the model ST6C from IEEE 421.5-2016,
    8.13 (ExcIEEEST6C) should be used.
    Parameter details:
    <ol>
    <li>The sign of the signal Voel is not correct in IEEE 421.5-2005. The
    sign in IEEE 421.5-2016 shall be used.</li>
    </ol>
    Reference: IEEE 421.5-2005, 7.6.
    According to IEEE 421.5-2016, 8.12 the ST6B excitation system model is
    being superseded by the model ST6C (ExcIEEEST6C).
    '''

