@dataclass(repr=False)
class ExcIEEEST9C(ExcitationSystemDynamics):
    '''
    IEEE 421.5-2016 ST9C excitation system model. It implements a proportional
    integral
    (PI) control logic. A differential stage is included in the path of the
    compensated voltage and the output of the differential stage is also added
    to the AVR summing point. This differential stage is intended to provide
    a faster reaction of the regulator in case of large voltage variations.
    A dead-band function is provided to eliminate the influence of the differential
    stage for small changes in the compensated voltage.
    Reference: IEEE 421.5-2016, 8.17.
    '''

