@dataclass(repr=False)
class PssIEEE4C(PowerSystemStabilizerDynamics):
    '''
    IEEE 421.5-2016 PSS4C power system stabilizer model. It is based on multiple
    working frequency bands. Four separate bands respectively dedicated to
    the very low-, low-, intermediate-, and high-frequency modes of oscillations
    are used in this delta-omega (speed input) PSS.
    This model has 2 input signals. They have the following fixed types (expressed
    in terms of InputSignalKind values): the first one is of rotorAngleFrequencyDeviation
    type and the second one is of generatorElectricalPower type.
    Reference: IEEE 421.5-2016, 9.9.
    '''

