@dataclass(repr=False)
class PssIEEE7C(PowerSystemStabilizerDynamics):
    '''
    IEEE 421.5-2016 PSS7C power system stabilizer model. This model has has
    exactly the same structure of the PSS2C model from the dual inputs up to
    the main PSS gain KS1. The phase compensation, however, is provided by
    a canonical state equation, similar to what is applied in the PSS6C model.
    Reference: IEEE 421.5-2016, 9.12.
    '''

